# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets / Pages _headers convention: this file
# must live at the root of `assets.directory` (see wrangler.jsonc — that's
# "." here, the repo root) to be read at all; a copy nested inside a
# subfolder is not recognized. Path patterns below scope the rules to that
# subfolder instead.
#
# Force docs-llm/*.md to be served as plain text (not octet-stream), so a
# browser or an LLM's raw HTTP fetch renders/reads it inline instead of
# triggering a download prompt.
/docs-llm/*.md
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
